<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>MarbleSec — Offensive Security</title>
<style>
  :root {
    --bg:#0b0b0c; --ink:#f2f1ec; --muted:#9a9a93; --line:#3a3a3a; --accent:#ff4a1c;
    --mono:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;
  }
  * { box-sizing:border-box; }
  body { margin:0; background:var(--bg); color:var(--ink); font-family:system-ui,sans-serif; line-height:1.6; }
  a { color:inherit; }
  .wrap { max-width:960px; margin:0 auto; padding:0 1.5rem; }
  .mono { font-family:var(--mono); }

  header { padding:4rem 0 3rem; }
  h1 { font-size:2.6rem; letter-spacing:-.03em; margin:0 0 1rem; }
  h1 span { color:var(--accent); }
  .lead { color:var(--muted); max-width:34rem; margin:0 0 1.5rem; }
  .btn { display:inline-block; padding:.7rem 1.2rem; background:var(--accent); color:#fff; text-decoration:none; font-family:var(--mono); font-size:.85rem; }
  .btn.ghost { background:none; border:1px solid var(--line); color:var(--ink); }

  h2 { font-size:1.8rem; letter-spacing:-.02em; border-bottom:1px solid var(--line); padding-bottom:.5rem; }
  section { padding:2.5rem 0; }

  ul.rows { list-style:none; padding:0; margin:0; }
  ul.rows li { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1.4fr; gap:1rem; padding:1rem 0; border-bottom:1px solid var(--line); }
  ul.rows h3 { margin:0; font-size:1.1rem; }
  ul.rows p { margin:0; color:var(--muted); }

  .grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(280px,1fr)); gap:1rem; }
  .card { border:1px solid var(--line); padding:1.2rem; text-decoration:none; }
  .card:hover { border-color:var(--accent); }
  .card h3 { margin:.4rem 0; font-size:1.2rem; }
  .card p { margin:0 0 .8rem; color:var(--muted); font-size:.92rem; }
  .card .meta { font-family:var(--mono); font-size:.75rem; color:var(--accent); }

  footer { border-top:1px solid var(--line); padding:1.5rem 0; font-family:var(--mono); font-size:.78rem; color:var(--muted); }
  footer .wrap { display:flex; justify-content:space-between; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:.5rem; }

  @media (max-width:640px) { ul.rows li { grid-template-columns:1fr; } }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header class="wrap">
  <h1>Learn. <span>Exploit.</span> Repeat.</h1>
  <p class="lead">Offensive security, one project at a time — building tools, breaking vulnerable apps on loopback, and documenting everything I learn.</p>
  <a class="btn" href="https://github.com/MarbleSec">GitHub →</a>
  <a class="btn ghost" href="#projects">See projects</a>
</header>

<section id="work" class="wrap">
  <h2>Build. Break. Learn.</h2>
  <ul class="rows">
    <li><h3>Web app testing</h3><p>SQL injection, auth bypasses, and hands-on practice against deliberately vulnerable platforms.</p></li>
    <li><h3>Exploitation</h3><p>Metasploit wrappers and simple exploit tooling to understand how attacks actually work.</p></li>
    <li><h3>C2 tooling</h3><p>Remote access tools built for learning red-team concepts in controlled lab scenarios.</p></li>
  </ul>
</section>

<section id="projects" class="wrap">
  <h2>Things I've built.</h2>
  <div class="grid">
    <a class="card" href="https://github.com/MarbleSec/HermiesRAT">
      <h3>HermiesRAT</h3>
      <p>Cross-platform TCP remote access tool for security testing and monitoring in your own lab.</p>
      <div class="meta">Python · View repo →</div>
    </a>
    <a class="card" href="https://github.com/MarbleSec/DamnVulnerableFlaskApplication">
      <h3>DVFA</h3>
      <p>Deliberately vulnerable Flask application for safe exploitation practice against your own loopback.</p>
      <div class="meta">Python · View repo →</div>
    </a>
    <a class="card" href="https://github.com/MarbleSec/PathBuster">
      <h3>PathBuster</h3>
      <p>Find, verify, and enumerate subdomains and paths during recon.</p>
      <div class="meta">Python · View repo →</div>
    </a>
  </div>
</section>

<footer>
  <div class="wrap">
    <span>© 2026 MarbleSec</span>
    <a href="https://github.com/MarbleSec">github.com/MarbleSec</a>
  </div>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
